    "text": "Let $Z$ = atomic number \r\n$M=$ atornic mass\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0017_e790706adea1.png\">\r\n\r\nHence, ${ }_{Z} E^{M}$ and ${ }_{2} E^{M-4}$ has same atomic number with different atomic mass thus, they are isotopes."
